 1497                   ; Read one 256 byte sector from disk.
 1498                   ; Return a 00h in A if the operation completes properly, and 01h if an error occurs during the read.
 1499                   ; Disk number in DBANK  (4..7)
 1500                   ; Track number in IOT
 1501                   ; Sector number in IOS
Z80ASM SuperFast Relocating Macro Assembler     	    Z80ASM 1.32 Page  25
